          "text": "Description: On April 4, 1978, around 2:45 a.m., a factory guard observed a white ball at high altitude in the sky above a state forest, five times. This ball, of variable size, moved very quickly. The ball gradually disappeared into the sky. No other witnesses or information were collected regarding this phenomenon, for which we lack details.",
